#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:55
msgid "Zinn® Cache"
msgstr "Zinn® Cache"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works."
msgstr "Predmemorija stranice i Redis objektna predmemorija za bilo koje WordPress web-mjesto. Koristi LiteSpeed poslužiteljsku predmemoriju tamo gdje postoji, a vlastitu predmemoriju na disku svugdje drugdje, briše samo ono na što neka promjena utječe i dokazuje da njegova Redis veza radi."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-admin.php:104
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija"

#: includes/class-admin.php:110
#: includes/class-admin.php:179
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija stranice"

#: includes/class-admin.php:114
#: includes/class-admin.php:264
msgid "Object cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija objekta"

#: includes/class-admin.php:118
msgid "Purging"
msgstr "Čišćenje"

#: includes/class-admin.php:122
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "Isključenja"

#: includes/class-admin.php:126
#: includes/class-admin.php:152
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:216
msgid "AI agents (MCP)"
msgstr "AI agenti (MCP)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:133
msgid "Purge everything now"
msgstr "Očisti sve odmah"

#: includes/class-admin.php:134
msgid "Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?"
msgstr "Svaka spremljena stranica bit će odbačena i ponovno izrađena kako posjetitelji budu dolazili. Želite li nastaviti?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:153
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:225
msgid "Allow AI agents (MCP)"
msgstr "Dopusti AI agentima (MCP)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:154
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:227
msgid "Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all."
msgstr "Isključeno: alati u nastavku i njihove REST rute uopće nisu registrirani."

#: includes/class-admin.php:173
msgid "Full-page cache"
msgstr "Predmemorija cijele stranice"

#: includes/class-admin.php:174
msgid "On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from."
msgstr "Na LiteSpeed poslužitelju, stranice poslužuje web poslužitelj prije nego što se WordPress pokrene. Na bilo kojem drugom poslužitelju, ovaj dodatak sprema svaku stranicu kao datoteku i poslužuje je prije nego što se WordPress učita. Od toga dolazi gotovo sva brzina."

#: includes/class-admin.php:180
msgid "Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in"
msgstr "Predmemorirajte stranice za posjetitelje koji nisu prijavljeni"

#: includes/class-admin.php:186
msgid "How long a page stays cached"
msgstr "Koliko dugo stranica ostaje u predmemoriji"

#: includes/class-admin.php:187
msgid "Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less."
msgstr "Sekunde. Tjedan dana odgovara većini web-mjesta; vijestima koje objavljuju svakog sata potrebno je znatno manje."

#: includes/class-admin.php:196
msgid "How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts"
msgstr "Koliko dugo posjetiteljev preglednik čuva slike i skripte"

#: includes/class-admin.php:197
msgid "Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host."
msgstr "Sekunde. Odnosi se samo na slike, CSS i JavaScript — nikada na stranice. Postavite na 0 da biste to prepustili svom pružatelju hostinga."

#: includes/class-admin.php:205
msgid "Signed-in visitors"
msgstr "Prijavljeni posjetitelji"

#: includes/class-admin.php:206
msgid "Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor"
msgstr "Nikada ne poslužujte predmemoriranu stranicu prijavljenom posjetitelju"

#: includes/class-admin.php:207
msgid "On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to."
msgstr "Uključeno je siguran odgovor i zadana postavka. Isključite ga samo ako znate da je svaka spremljena stranica potpuno identična za svakog prijavljenog korisnika – članske stranice uobičajeni su razlog za to."

#: includes/class-admin.php:213
msgid "Different lifetimes for different content"
msgstr "Različiti životni vijek za različite sadržaje"

#: includes/class-admin.php:214
msgid "For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week."
msgstr "Na primjer: stranice s proizvodima trgovine na sat vremena, dok sve ostalo ostaje tjedan dana."

#: includes/class-admin.php:215
msgid "Add a rule"
msgstr "Dodaj pravilo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:222
msgid "Content type"
msgstr "Vrsta sadržaja"

#: includes/class-admin.php:228
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Sekunde"

#: includes/class-admin.php:249
#: includes/class-admin.php:258
msgid "Object cache (Redis)"
msgstr "Objektna predmemorija (Redis)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:250
msgid "Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working."
msgstr "Vaš poslužitelj pokreće privatnu Redis objektnu predmemoriju za ovu web-lokaciju i održava je konfiguriranom. Ovdje se ništa ne mora postavljati; status na vrhu ovog zaslona prikazuje radi li ispravno."

#: includes/class-admin.php:259
msgid "Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot."
msgstr "Pohranjuje rezultate upita baze podataka u predmemoriju. Najviše pomaže u prometnoj trgovini ili na web-mjestu s puno prijavljenog prometa, gdje predmemorija stranice ne može pomoći."

#: includes/class-admin.php:265
msgid "Install the Redis object-cache drop-in"
msgstr "Instalirajte Redis dodatak za predmemoriju objekata"

#: includes/class-admin.php:266
msgid "Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so."
msgstr "Potrebna je phpredis ekstenzija. Ako nedostaje, okvir iznad ovog zaslona to prikazuje."

#: includes/class-admin.php:272
msgid "Redis host"
msgstr "Redis poslužitelj (host)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:279
msgid "Redis port"
msgstr "Redis priključak (port)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:288
msgid "Redis database"
msgstr "Redis baza podataka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:289
msgid "Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache."
msgstr "Dodijelite svakoj stranici na zajedničkom Redis vlastiti broj kako ne bi međusobno brisale predmemoriju."

#: includes/class-admin.php:298
msgid "Redis username"
msgstr "Korisničko ime za Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:299
msgid "Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone."
msgstr "Samo za Redis poslužitelj s ACL korisnicima (Redis 6 ili noviji). Ostavite prazno za prijavu samo pomoću lozinke."

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
msgid "Redis password"
msgstr "Redis lozinka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:308
msgid "Leave blank if your Redis does not need one."
msgstr "Ostavite prazno ako vaš Redis nije potreban."

#: includes/class-admin.php:315
msgid "Key prefix"
msgstr "Prefiks ključa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:316
msgid "An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one."
msgstr "Alternativa zasebnom broju baze podataka kada ga ne možete imati."

#: includes/class-admin.php:333
msgid "Smart auto-purge"
msgstr "Pametno automatsko čišćenje"

#: includes/class-admin.php:334
msgid "Clear affected pages automatically when content changes"
msgstr "Automatski očisti zahvaćene stranice kada se sadržaj promijeni"

#: includes/class-admin.php:340
msgid "After updates"
msgstr "Nakon ažuriranja"

#: includes/class-admin.php:341
msgid "Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update"
msgstr "Očistite sve nakon ažuriranja jezgre, dodatka ili teme"

#: includes/class-admin.php:347
msgid "After a comment"
msgstr "Nakon komentara"

#: includes/class-admin.php:348
msgid "Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved"
msgstr "Očistite stranicu objave kada je komentar na nju odobren"

#: includes/class-admin.php:349
msgid "Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour."
msgstr "Isključite ovo u odjeljku s komentarima koji je vrlo posjećen, gdje se ista stranica može očistiti stotine puta na sat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:364
msgid "Never cache these"
msgstr "Nikad ne predmemoriraj ove"

#: includes/class-admin.php:365
msgid "Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below."
msgstr "Razumne zadane postavke za WordPress i WooCommerce uvijek se primjenjuju – košarica, naplata, moj-račun i svaka prijavljena sesija nikada se ne predmemoriraju, bez obzira na sve što je ispod."

#: includes/class-admin.php:371
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Adrese"

#: includes/class-admin.php:372
msgid "One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it."
msgstr "Jedna staza po retku, na primjer <code>/basket</code>. Vodeća <code>*</code> podudara se sa svemu ispod nje."

#: includes/class-admin.php:380
msgid "Query parameters"
msgstr "Parametri upita"

#: includes/class-admin.php:381
msgid "A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token."
msgstr "Stranica koja sadrži jednu od ovih nikada se ne predmemorira – na primjer, jednokratni token za pretpregled."

#: includes/class-admin.php:389
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Kolačići"

#: includes/class-admin.php:390
msgid "A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page."
msgstr "Posjetitelju koji nosi jedan od ovih uvijek se poslužuje svježa stranica."

#: includes/class-admin.php:419
msgid "Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive."
msgstr "Svaka predmemorirana stranica je uklonjena. Bit će ponovno izrađene kako posjetitelji budu dolazili."

#: includes/class-admin.php:445
msgid "The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything."
msgstr "Predmemorija objekata je instalirana, ali ništa ne sprema."

#: includes/class-admin.php:459
msgid "The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet."
msgstr "Predmemorija stranice je uključena, ali stranice se još ne spremaju."

#: includes/class-admin.php:460
msgid "WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php."
msgstr "WordPress još nije učitao dodatak za predmemoriju stranice (page-cache drop-in). Pokrenut će se pri sljedećem učitavanju stranice; ako se to ne dogodi, provjerite je li WP_CACHE postavljen na true u datoteci wp-config.php."

#: includes/class-admin.php:469
msgid "The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support."
msgstr "Predmemorija objekata je uključena, ali ovaj poslužitelj nema podršku za Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:470
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Proširenje phpredis nije instalirano, pa se dodatak ne može koristiti i WordPress se vraća na vlastitu predmemoriju u memoriji. Zatražite od svog pružatelja usluga udomljavanja da omogući phpredis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:478
msgid "Nothing is being cached."
msgstr "Ništa se ne predmemorira."

#: includes/class-admin.php:479
msgid "Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster."
msgstr "Oba su predmemoriranja isključena, tako da ovaj dodatak ne ubrzava web-mjesto."

#: includes/class-admin.php:486
msgid "Caching is active on this site."
msgstr "Predmemoriranje je aktivno na ovoj web-lokaciji."

#: includes/class-admin.php:521
msgid "Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen."
msgstr "Redis je odbio korisničko ime ili lozinku. Provjerite Redis vjerodajnice u datoteci wp-config.php ili na ovom zaslonu."

#: includes/class-admin.php:523
msgid "Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site's key prefix."
msgstr "Redis je prihvatio prijavu, ali ovom web-mjestu ne dopušta pohranu ključeva. Korisniku sustava Redis potrebna je dozvola za prefiks ključa ovog web-mjesta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:525
msgid "Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting."
msgstr "Redis je odbio broj baze podataka. Provjerite postavkama baze podataka za Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:527
msgid "Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data."
msgstr "Redis je ostao bez memorije i odbija nove podatke."

#: includes/class-admin.php:529
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Proširenje phpredis nije instalirano, stoga WordPress koristi vlastitu memorijsku predmemoriju. Zatražite od svog davatelja hostinga da omogući phpredis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:531
msgid "WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off."
msgstr "WP_REDIS_DISABLED je postavljeno u wp-config.php, pa je predmemorija objekata isključena."

#: includes/class-admin.php:533
msgid "The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running."
msgstr "Poslužitelj za Redis nije dostupan. Provjerite host i port za Redis te radi li Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:535
msgid "Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server's logs."
msgstr "Redis nije vratio vrijednost koja mu je upravo upisana. Provjerite zapisnike poslužitelja Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:550
msgid "Web server"
msgstr "Web-poslužitelj"

#: includes/class-admin.php:552
msgid "LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server"
msgstr "LiteSpeed — stranice se predmemoriraju na web poslužitelju"

#: includes/class-admin.php:553
msgid "not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin"
msgstr "nije LiteSpeed — stranice se spremaju u predmemoriju na disku pomoću ovog dodatka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:556
msgid "Pages stored on disk"
msgstr "Stranice pohranjene na disku"

#: includes/class-admin.php:560
msgid "Redis support"
msgstr "Podrška za Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:562
msgid "phpredis is installed"
msgstr "phpredis je instaliran"

#: includes/class-admin.php:563
msgid "phpredis is not installed"
msgstr "phpredis nije instaliran"

#: includes/class-admin.php:566
msgid "Page lifetime"
msgstr "Vijek stranice"

#: includes/class-admin.php:641
msgid "You are not allowed to purge the cache."
msgstr "Nemate dopuštenje za čišćenje predmemorije."

#: includes/class-admin.php:647
msgid "Cache purge requested."
msgstr "Zatraženo je čišćenje predmemorije."

#: includes/class-admin.php:675
msgid "Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin."
msgstr "Zinn® Cache: instaliran je drugi dodatak za predmemoriju objekata, tako da Redis predmemorijom objekata ne upravlja ovaj dodatak."

#: includes/class-admin.php:689
msgid "detected"
msgstr "otkriveno"

#: includes/class-admin.php:690
msgid "not detected"
msgstr "nije otkriveno"

#: includes/class-admin.php:694
msgid "phpredis extension missing"
msgstr "nedostaje phpredis ekstenzija"

#: includes/class-admin.php:696
msgid "installed, not storing anything"
msgstr "instalirano, ništa se ne pohranjuje"

#: includes/class-admin.php:698
msgid "active, managed by your host"
msgstr "aktivan, upravlja vaš poslužitelj"

#: includes/class-admin.php:700
msgid "active"
msgstr "aktivno"

#: includes/class-admin.php:702
msgid "inactive"
msgstr "neaktivno"

#: includes/class-admin.php:707
msgid "LiteSpeed cache:"
msgstr "LiteSpeed predmemorija:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:709
msgid "Redis object cache:"
msgstr "Redis objektna predmemorija:"

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:256
msgid "The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled."
msgstr "Redis PHP ekstenzija (phpredis) nije dostupna na ovom poslužitelju, pa se objektna predmemorija ne može omogućiti."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:263
msgid "Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache."
msgstr "Još jedan dodatak za predmemoriju objekata (object-cache) već je instaliran. Uklonite ga prije nego što omogućite Zinn® predmemoriju objekata."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:275
msgid "Could not write the Redis connection configuration file."
msgstr "Nije bilo moguće zapisati konfiguracijsku datoteku Redis veze."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:283
msgid "The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read."
msgstr "Priloženi object-cache drop-in nije bilo moguće pročitati."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:290
msgid "Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content."
msgstr "Nije bilo moguće instalirati object-cache drop-in u wp-content."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:316
msgid "Could not remove the object-cache drop-in."
msgstr "Nije bilo moguće ukloniti object-cache drop-in."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:411
msgid "The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed."
msgstr "WordPress datotečni sustav nije zapisiv, pa object-cache drop-in nije bilo moguće postaviti."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:328
msgid "Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache."
msgstr "Još jedan dodatak za predmemoriju stranice instalirao je wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Prvo uklonite taj dodatak ili nastavite koristiti njegovu predmemoriju stranice."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:331
msgid "The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached."
msgstr "Mapa wp-content/cache/zinn-cache se ne može zapisati, pa se stranice ne mogu predmemorirati."

#: includes/class-page-cache.php:338
msgid "wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached."
msgstr "Datoteku wp-content/advanced-cache.php nije bilo moguće zapisati, pa se stranice ne mogu pohraniti u predmemoriju."

#: includes/class-updater.php:250
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Pogledajte bilješke o izdanju za Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-updater.php:299
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Usluga ažuriranja Zinn® nije izdala vezu za preuzimanje ovog ažuriranja. Provjerite može li ovo web-mjesto pristupiti platformi Zinn®, a zatim pokušajte ponovno."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-updater.php:313
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Ažuriranje se nije moglo preuzeti s usluge ažuriranja Zinn® (%s). Pokušajte ponovno za nekoliko minuta."

#: includes/class-updater.php:327
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Preuzeto ažuriranje nije prošlo provjeru integriteta te nije instalirano."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:85
msgid "Go Pro"
msgstr "Prijeđi na Pro"

#: includes/class-upsell.php:112
msgid "A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands."
msgstr "Zaslon analitike priručne memorije: omjer pogotka, memorija, ključevi i najsporije naredbe priručne memorije."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:113
msgid "A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible."
msgstr "Alat za pronalaženje sporih upita i nekemiranih poziva koji imenuje odgovarajući dodatak ili temu."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:114
msgid "An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer."
msgstr "In-memoriam razina APCu ispred sustava Redis za najtraženije ključeve, uz preddohvat, sažimanje i igbinary serijalizator."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:115
msgid "Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together."
msgstr "Čišćenje predmemorije na temelju oznaka za objave, pojmove i WooCommerce proizvode, tako da se briše samo ono što je promijenjeno, uz istovremeno čišćenje predmemorije stranica i objekata."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:116
msgid "Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript."
msgstr "Automatsko zagrijavanje predmemorije nakon čišćenja, WebP i AVIF slike, uklanjanje nekorištenog CSS-a i odgođeni JavaScript."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:117
msgid "Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules."
msgstr "Zakazano čišćenje baze podataka s pretpregledom i pravilima predmemorije po stranici."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:118
msgid "Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills."
msgstr "Upozorenja o stanju predmemorije na vašoj nadzornoj ploči Zinn Digital® kada omjer pogodaka padne ili se memorija napuni."

#: includes/class-upsell.php:132
msgid "Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:"
msgstr "Sve na drugim karticama je besplatno i ostaje besplatno. Pro se instalira preko ovog dodatka i dodaje:"

#: includes/class-upsell.php:134
msgid "See what Pro costs"
msgstr "Pogledajte cijene Pro paketa"

#. translators: 1: yearly price for one site, 2: for five sites, 3: for unlimited sites (each already formatted, e.g. $49).
#: includes/class-upsell.php:138
#, php-format
msgid "Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites."
msgstr "Svaki paket počinje s 14 dana besplatnog probnog razdoblja, kartica nije potrebna: %1$s godišnje za jedno web-mjesto, %2$s za pet web-mjesta, %3$s za neograničen broj web-mjesta."

#: includes/class-wp-config.php:66
msgid "wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( 'WP_CACHE', true ); to it."
msgstr "Datoteka wp-config.php nije pronađena, pa se WP_CACHE nije mogao uključiti. Dodajte u nju define( 'WP_CACHE', true );."

#: includes/class-wp-config.php:72
